  "title": "Abelian varieties",
  "statement": "Let $k$ be a field. An *abelian variety* over $k$ is a\ngroup scheme $A$ over $k$ which\nis proper, smooth and connected over $k$. A group scheme with\nthese three properties is also called a *complete group\nvariety*;",
